# Higgsfield image generation for Phideo

## No text in images — ever

Generated photos must be clean: no lettering of any kind.

- End every image prompt with: "Clean photograph with absolutely no text, no lettering,
  no typography, no captions, no signage, no watermarks, no logos, no UI labels."
- Never use layout or design words in shot prompts (e.g. "space for a headline",
  "built to carry type", "hero", "CTA") — models render them as literal baked-in text.
  Describe *light and space* instead: "the bottom third falls to soft shadow",
  "an empty wall fills the left of frame".
- QA every generated image for stray text before shipping; any lettering = reshoot.

## Happy brand — vibrant and light

Phideo is a happy brand. Default grade is bright, vibrant and light:

- Prompt for: warm natural daylight, golden hour, airy rooms, saturated colour,
  joyful genuine expressions, vivid living phone screens.
- Avoid: muddy, desaturated, gloomy, oppressive or horror-adjacent moods.
- The campaign register (design-system §5) may go darker for drama, but even then the
  colour stays rich and the screen glows vividly — dark ≠ dull, and the emotion stays
  positive (wonder, awe), never bleak.
